#~ "ships would ambush a station. Stations could not maintain defensive "
#~ "patrols indefinitely due to the expense. Putting in a warp jammer gives "
#~ "the station a chance to scramble their defense fleet when an enemy "
#~ "approaches. Of course, it slows friendly traffic, commercial or military, "
#~ "too. So, most warp jammers are controlled by nearby factions to allow "
#~ "them to enable or disable them upon request to facilitate the flow of "
#~ "ships. You can't connect to the warp jammer while docked because you're "
#~ "clearly not yet ready to traverse the controlled area. Destroying a warp "
#~ "jammer may have undesired indirect consequences, but there's no official "
#~ "rule against it."
